Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Present impact, examples, and reporting consequences to the steward, then publish a versioned release and migration plan. Notify dependent systems, invalidate only relevant classification caches, and preserve old definitions for historical queries.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
